<title>USA: Philip Morris issues $500 mln debt at +75.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris issues $500 mln debt at +75.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Philip Morris Cos Inc was priced Wednesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER PHILIP MORRIS COS INC</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 7.50 PCT   MATURITY 4/01/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.527  FIRST PAY DATE 10/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.588 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 75 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
</text>
